id: medibugs
name: Medibugs
kind: gear
# A Special Basic Item: only the ARC hands them out, and nothing crafts them.
special: true
# "Upon gaining this Basic Item, select up to 1d6 Medibugs from the categories below."
portionsDice: 1d6
portions: revive, achichi, zutsu, beaut
# "You can spend 1 Action to consume a Medibug and apply the benefits listed."
placeCost: 1
# "Revive Bug. Regain Life Points and Ki Points up to their maximums."
reviveLabel: Revive Bug
reviveFull: true
# "Achichi Bug. Remove any stacks of Damage Over Time and/or the Broken Combat Condition."
achichiLabel: Achichi Bug
achichiDot: true
achichiRemoves: broken
# "Zutsu Bug. Remove the Impaired and/or the Impediment Combat Conditions."
zutsuLabel: Zutsu Bug
zutsuRemoves: impaired, impediment
# "Beaut Bug. Increase your Persuasion Skill Checks by 2 for an hour."
beautLabel: Beaut Bug
beautGains: beautified
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Up to 1d6 bugs of four kinds, an Action each: Life and Ki full; Damage Over Time and Broken
  gone; Impaired and Impediment gone; or Persuasion 2 better for an hour.
text: >
  Medibugs: These bugs have medicinal properties when consumed. Slimy, but satisfying.
  –Effects: Upon gaining this Basic Item, select up to 1d6 Medibugs from the categories below.
  You gain those Medibugs. You can spend 1 Action to consume a Medibug and apply the benefits
  listed:

  * Revive Bug. Regain Life Points and Ki Points up to their maximums.
  * Achichi Bug. Remove any stacks of Damage Over Time and/or the Broken Combat Condition.
  * Zutsu Bug. Remove the Impaired and/or the Impediment Combat Conditions.
  * Beaut Bug. Increase your Persuasion Skill Checks by 2 for an hour.

---

# --- What the system does ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Given: 1d6 rolled, and the player shares out up to that many among the four kinds. Each
# kind with any left is a button on the row, an Action and a bug each.
#
# Revive: Life and Ki to their maximum. Achichi: every stack of Damage Over Time and of
# Broken off. Zutsu: Impaired and Impediment off. Beaut: the Beautified mark, 2 on every
# Persuasion Check.
#
# --- What the table keeps ----------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# "For an hour" is story time, and nothing here counts hours: Beautified lasts until the
# player ends it, from the Combat tab where marks are shown.
